{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0001", "offset": 32, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "▨ [須](『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽). 篠原啓方 463쪽에서는 [洹]로 보면서 ‘洄’ ‘洰’ ‘泗’ ‘河’ ‘洒’ 등일 가능성도 언급하였다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0002", "offset": 33, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "百 ▨(『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0003", "offset": 34, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "▨ 篠原啓方 463쪽은 해당 글자의 상부를 ‘土’로 추정하였다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0004", "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "得 [行](『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0005", "offset": 45, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "㖨 喙(『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽), ▼(篠原啓方 463쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0006", "offset": 49, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "▨ 해당 글자의 우변을 者로 추정(『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽; 篠原啓方 463쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0007", "offset": 59, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "科 柯(篠原啓方 463쪽). 『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽은 해당 글자의 좌변을 ‘禾’로 추정하였다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0008", "offset": 61, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "▨ 去(『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽). 篠原啓方 463쪽은 해당 글자의 상부를 ‘吉’로 추정하였다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_003_0010_0010_gskh_003_0010_0010_0020", "id": "gskh_003_0010_0010_0020_0009", "offset": 80, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "其 ▨(『新羅文字資料Ⅰ』 135쪽)", "type": "각주"}
